    {
      "bbox": [
        350,
        1657,
        1860,
        2087
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A Council on Playlots has been established in order to ensure that playlots will be constructed rapidly and to avoid duplication of effort and red-tape. (A playlot is a vacant lot that has been cleared of debris, blacktopped and turned into temporary recreational space). The Council on Playlots will be responsible for coordinating the activities of all city agencies involved intthe construction of playlots.",
